Lint, format and auto-fix Groovy, Jenkinsfile, Gradle files using command
line. Based on CodeNarc, this out of the box package allows to track groovy
errors and correct a part of them:
 - Use option --format to format & prettify source code
 - Use option --fix to activate autofixing of fixable rules
Easy to integrate in a CI/CD process (Jenkins Pipeline, CircleCI).
